    "summary_one_sentence": "Driven by a thirst for vengeance after the brutal murder of her family, Red Sonja trains to become a legendary warrior woman fighting against evil forces in a mythical age.",
    "summary_short": "After surviving a tragic attack that wipes out her family and leaves her for dead, Red Sonja receives extraordinary strength and combat skills from a mystical vision. Transformed into the fierce She-Devil with a Sword, she embarks on a perilous quest to avenge her fallen kin and confront tyrant powers. Along her journey, she tests her resolve against dangerous monsters, corrupt rulers, and her own tragic past. Ultimately, Sonja rises as an unrivaled warrior and an enduring symbol of defiance in a lawless fantasy world.",
    "summary_long": "Red Sonja opens with a terrifying act of violence that shatters a young girl's peaceful life, leaving her family dead and her home in ashes. Miraculously surviving the assault, Sonja receives a divine vision granting her exceptional physical capabilities on the strict condition that she never give herself to a man unless he defeats her in fair combat. Fuelled by grief and an unyielding desire for justice, she dedicates her life to mastering swordplay, archery, and tactical warfare. As news of her formidable prowess spreads across the realm, she earns the fearsome title of the She-Devil with a Sword. Her journey takes her across treacherous wildernesses, ancient ruins, and decadent city-states ruled by ruthless tyrants. Along the way, Sonja forms uneasy alliances with fellow mercenaries and outcasts who respect her matchless martial skill. She repeatedly crosses blades with dark sorcerers, monstrous beasts, and corrupt armies sent to eliminate her. Facing overwhelming odds, Sonja relies on her cunning, brute strength, and tactical instinct to dismantle the oppressive power structure that destroyed her childhood. In a climatic battle, she confronts the mastermind behind her tragic origin, proving that her warrior spirit cannot be broken. Ultimately, Red Sonja cements her legendary legacy, carving out a pathway to freedom for the innocent while wandering the ancient world as a feared and respected warrior.",
    "synopsis": "Red Sonja is a high-fantasy action epic that chronicles the origin and rise of fantasy fiction's most iconic sword-wielding heroine. Set in a mythical, unforgiving age of sorcery and steel, the story follows young Sonja, whose life is forever altered by a sudden and devastating tragedy. Rising from the ashes of her shattered past, she transforms herself into a legendary combatant known throughout the realm as the She-Devil with a Sword. Rich with grand adventure, dramatic conflicts, and rich dark-fantasy worldbuilding, the narrative explores themes of resilience, justice, and self-determination as Sonja navigates a world filled with despotic rulers, ancient evils, and perilous wildernesses.",
